// transition: inputs and reads hold enough tokens, inhibitors hold too few,
// and bounded output places have room. Every check precedes every mutation.
//
// Everything above main() embeds cleanly; main() is a demo driver that fires
// the first enabled transition (in sorted order) until none is, printing one
